OL,2,V55555555CPOLICE HUNT
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5C'DANGEROUS' GUNMAN
OL,4,B
OL,5, Police are hunting a gunman they say is
OL,6, highly dangerous who shot and wounded
OL,7, his former girlfriend's lover at
OL,8, Andover, Hampshire.
OL,10, Police say that James Rae, 40, is
OL,11, "desperate" and the public should not
OL,12, approach him.
OL,14, He fled after shooting Keith Harman,
OL,15, 39, in the chest. He is in a serious
OL,16, but stable condition in hospital.
OL,18,SGA policeman is in hospital with gun-
OL,19, shot wounds after a series of shooting
OL,20, incidents in Norwich which ended with
OL,21, the discovery of a man's body.
OL,23,F]DFrom 16-03-85 / teletextarchive.com
