OL,2,V55555555CSNOW BRINGS CHAOS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CAND DEATH
OL,5, Snow, storms and high winds brought
OL,6, chaos and death to Britain just four
OL,7, days before the start of Spring.
OL,9, The worst-hit county was Hampshire
OL,10, where a man who left his car on the M27
OL,11, died after being hit by another vehicle
OL,13, The AA said roads were a "disaster
OL,14, area" after freak snow and hail storms.
OL,16, Snow blocked roads in Cornwall and
OL,17, Devon, while cross-Pennine roads and
OL,18, routes in Scotland were impassable.
OL,20, Gale-force winds hit Wales and the West
OL,21, Country with weathermen saying more bad
OL,22, weather is on the way.
OL,23,F]DFrom 16-03-85 / teletextarchive.com
