OL,2,V55555555CBISHOP WARNS OF
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CPOLICE STATE
OL,5, Government policies are in danger of
OL,6, turning Britain into a police state,
OL,7, the Bishop of Durham has claimed.
OL,9, Dr David Jenkins accused the Government
OL,10, of failing to appreciate the "dangerous
OL,11, resentment" it was creating.
OL,13, He urged it to change its "socially
OL,14, divisive economic policies".
OL,16, Speaking on Channel 4's Credo, he said
OL,17, there was a total,or near-total,failure
OL,18, to appreciate how bitter people felt.
OL,20, By giving tax advantages of the better-
OL,21, -off, he said, the Goverment gave the
OL,22, impression that it favoured one class.
OL,23,F]DFrom 16-03-85 / teletextarchive.com
