OL,2,V55555555C3,000 REMEMBER
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CMINER WHO DIED
OL,5, About 3,000 people marched through the
OL,6, Notts pit village of Ollerton to
OL,7, commemorate the death of a Yorkshire
OL,8, miner on the picket line a year ago.
OL,10, The miner, David Jones, 24, was found
OL,11, to have died of ruptured blood vessels
OL,12, around the heart.
OL,14, Police stopped most of the marchers
OL,15, from walking to the spot outside the
OL,16, gates where Mr Jones died, but two
OL,17, minutes' silence was observed.
OL,19, In Glasgow,Labour energy spokesman Stan
OL,20, Orme told a rally in support of sacked
OL,21, miners the Scottish NCB was behaving
OL,22, "like a 19th century factory owner".
OL,23,F]DFrom 16-03-85 / teletextarchive.com
