OL,1,S]T|l0|h4xl0|l0|h4 ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,D9/9
OL,2,S]Tn1j5`0n1/n5A ENGLAND v SCOTLAND
OL,3,S]T/*%+.!+,%/.!+.! ,,,,DTwickenhamT,,,,
OL,4,F
OL,5,FEngland's first championship try at
OL,6,FTwickenham in three years gave them the
OL,7,FCalcutta Cup and left Scotland holding
OL,8,Fthe championship wooden spoon.
OL,10,FWasps' wing Simon Smith raced over in
OL,11,Fthe corner in the 67th minute after
OL,12,FPeter Dods failed to hold on to an up-
OL,13,Fand-under from Rob Andrew.
OL,15,FBut England's other wing Rory Underwood
OL,16,Fensured their 10-7 victory wrenching
OL,17,Fthe ball out of Iain Paxton's hands as
OL,18,Fhe dived over in the dying minutes.
OL,20,FAndrew kicked two thundering penalties
OL,21,Fand missed two in front of the posts
OL,22,Fwhile Keith Robertson scored a try with
OL,23,Fa jinking run and Dods hit a penalty.
